      "statement": "The fatal-versus-warn boot policy keys on mode: git sync failure is fatal in FRESH and BUILD but only records a stale-checkout warning on restore and repo-image boots, setup.sh runs only in FRESH/BUILD (fatal in BUILD, warn in FRESH), and start.sh runs in every non-build boot with the primary repository's failure fatal and secondaries warning.",
